      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on patient lead generation + booking conversion for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics in Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code), local landmarks (Vashi + Nerul + Belapur + Kharghar + Kamothe), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
