    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Patient lead generation for a haircare + trichology clinic in Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra is long-cycle — patients research 4-12 weeks before booking. Nurture-heavy playbook + WhatsApp long-cycle flow + educational content-first. This FAQ answers 12 questions Navi Mumbai trichology clinics ask.</p>
