    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD CLINIC MARKETING &mdash; WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-stack digital marketing for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. Social media management + Reels + viral content, Meta + Google ads, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, Google Business Profile optimisation + local SEO, and patient lead generation. We work with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating the marketing function as an outsourced growth partner, not a vendor. Every answer below reflects live clinic work.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What channels generate the most patient leads for a Navi Mumbai trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">GMB + local search 30-35%, Meta Instagram + Reels 25-30%, Google Search + Ads 15-20%, YouTube + long-form content 10-15%, WhatsApp CTWA 10-15%, organic SEO + content 10-15%, referral 15-25%.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What CPQL for a Navi Mumbai trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Rs 200-600 general hair-loss inquiry, Rs 400-1,000 PRP/GFC-specific. Lead-to-consultation 25-40%. Cost per booked consultation Rs 600-3,000. Consultation-to-treatment 25-50%. Effective cost per acquired patient Rs 2,500-12,000. LTV Rs 60,000-5 lakh over 24-36 months for retained patient (long-cycle treatment) → strong CAC:LTV 5:1 to 20:1.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does WhatsApp + long-cycle nurture work for Navi Mumbai trichology lead conversion?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Different from dermatology — trichology leads are long-cycle. WhatsApp Cloud API long-cycle flows: welcome + hair-loss assessment + educational content week 1-2 + video-consultation booking + confirmation + reminder + post-consultation follow-up + treatment plan discussion + weekly during 6-12 month PRP/GFC treatment + progress documentation + retention. Response SLA 15 min. Marathi + Hindi + English + Gujarati native templates. Conversion 25-45%.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What lead qualification for trichology?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">BANT + fit + hair-loss stage (androgenetic vs telogen vs alopecia vs post-illness) + treatment-readiness (immediate vs exploring). MQL score ≥ 40. SQL ≥ 60 + long-cycle intent. CRM + Klaviyo.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we track trichology patient lead flow end-to-end?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same CRM + attribution stack as dermatology + long-cycle 90-180 day attribution window. Multi-touch attribution (6-15 touchpoints). Cohort LTV over 24 months.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much monthly lead flow for a Navi Mumbai trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Solo (Rs 3-10 lakh): 40-100 inquiries → 15-40 consultations → 8-25 treated. 2-3 doctor (Rs 12-40 lakh): 100-300 → 40-100 → 20-60. Multi-location: 300+ → 100+ → 60+.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do landing pages + content-led lead-gen work for trichology?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Landing pages per treatment (Navi Mumbai-specific: PRP Cost Navi Mumbai, GFC Hair Loss Navi Mumbai) + hair-loss quiz + concern-assessment tool + educational blog + email + WhatsApp long-cycle nurture. Conversion 5-12% for well-executed.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What compliance issues for trichology lead-gen?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same base + hair-regrowth substantiation + PRP/GFC/mesotherapy non-miracle positioning + patient data privacy.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle patient referrals for a Navi Mumbai trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">3/6/12-month post-treatment WhatsApp asks for review + referral. Referral programme structured (ethics-compliant). Referral LTV 3-5x paid lead LTV.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are common lead-gen mistakes for Navi Mumbai trichology clinics?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) No long-cycle WhatsApp nurture (leaks 40-60% during 4-12 week research phase). (2) Response time >15 min. (3) Weak landing pages. (4) No YouTube long-form for research-phase buyer. (5) English-only in Navi Mumbai. (6) No cohort LTV tracking. (7) Weak referral programme. (8) No email + WhatsApp educational nurture.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What monthly reporting for trichology lead-gen?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same as dermatology + long-cycle metrics + 6-month cohort LTV projection + retention rate + referral velocity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD generate trichology patient leads in Navi Mumbai?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack + long-cycle: WhatsApp long-cycle nurture + Meta + Google + YouTube + GMB + review generation + educational content-led + landing-page CRO + CRM + long-cycle attribution + weekly review + monthly QBR. Multilingual + ASCI-compliant. Bundled with full retainer (Rs 35,000-2.5 lakh).</div>
      </div>
    </div>

